30],[9725,21.9,2011,46,64,29]],"links":[["Webb County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/texas/webb-county"],["ARC or PLC in Webb County","/arc-plc/texas/webb-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, March to April came in under 90% of normal in 43 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 16 grids. In 2025 the middle had October to November at 8% of normal and November to December at 13%. The 2026 record so far turned the other way, with May to June at 187% on the middle. Grid 9421 had its driest year in 1956 at 52%, while grid 8823 bottomed out in 2011 at 40%.</p>"}
